title: 'statement-store: turn the v2 DHT path on by default'
doc:
- audience: [Node Operator, Node Dev]
  description: |-
    A node with the statement store now takes the v2 DHT path by default. The new
    `--no-statement-v2-dht` flag on the substrate node and the omni-node turns it off, so
    statements flood to every peer as before. The `STATEMENT_STORE_V2_DHT_ENABLED` environment
    variable is gone; node binaries set the gate once from the CLI with `set_v2dht_enabled`.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: minor
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: minor
